# =============================================================================
# Politica de versionado del repositorio (Tesis NER Clinico)
# =============================================================================
# SE VERSIONA:
#   - Scripts (scripts/), notebooks (notebooks/) y documentacion (docs/, *.md)
#   - Summaries ligeros de datos y entrenamiento:
#       data/processed/01_summary.json
#       data/augmented_*/02_summary.json
#       models/*/03_train_summary.json, config.json, labels.json, tokenizer*.json
#   - Artefactos ligeros de evaluacion (Fase 4) y visualizacion (Fase 5) en results/
#
# NO SE VERSIONA:
#   - Entornos virtuales, caches y logs
#   - Corpus procesados/aumentados en JSONL (regenerables con scripts 01 y 02, seed=42)
#   - Respaldos locales (data/archive/) y corridas de humo (models/smoke_*/)
#   - Pesos pesados de modelos (*.safetensors, *.bin, *.pt) y checkpoints intermedios
#   - Predicciones completas por token (results/*/04_predictions.jsonl)
# =============================================================================

# Entorno y caches de Python / Jupyter
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.log

# Respaldos locales y artefactos obsoletos
data/archive/

# Datasets JSONL generados (regenerables de forma determinista con 01 y 02)
data/processed/*.jsonl
data/augmented/*.jsonl
data/augmented_baseline/*.jsonl
data/augmented_50/*.jsonl
data/augmented_100/*.jsonl
!data/processed/01_summary.json
!data/augmented_baseline/02_summary.json
!data/augmented_50/02_summary.json
!data/augmented_100/02_summary.json

# Pesos de modelos entrenados, checkpoints y pruebas de humo
checkpoints/
runs/
models/smoke_beto/
models/smoke_*/
models/ner_model/
models/**/checkpoints/
models/**/*.safetensors
models/**/*.bin
models/**/*.pt
models/**/*.pth
models/**/*.h5
models/**/optimizer.pt
models/**/scheduler.pt
models/**/rng_state.pth

# Predicciones crudas a nivel documento (opcionales y voluminosas)
results/*/04_predictions.jsonl
